title: "Stratifying Hospital Readmission Penalties by Community Social Vulnerability: reproducible analysis code and public input data"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis pipeline for a budget-neutral simulation of Medicare's
  Hospital Readmissions Reduction Program (HRRP). A single Jupyter notebook
  reproduces CMS's FY2026 payment-adjustment factor from public data and
  recomputes penalties under CDC/ATSDR Social Vulnerability Index (SVI) peer
  grouping, holding total penalty dollars fixed, with county-clustered inference
  and bootstrap confidence intervals.
